<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><title>Affiliate · <%= siteName %></title><link rel="icon" href="/branding/favicon"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/customer-portal.css"></head><% function money(minor,c){try{return new Intl.NumberFormat('en-GB',{style:'currency',currency:c}).format(Number(minor||0)/100)}catch(_){return `${c} ${(Number(minor||0)/100).toFixed(2)}`}} const balances=new Map((state.balances||[]).map(x=>[x.currency,x]));const selected=balances.get(currency)||{available_minor:0,pending_minor:0}; %><body><div class="portalShell"><header class="portalTopbar"><div class="brandLockup"><img class="brandLogo" src="/branding/logo" alt=""><div><div class="brandName"><%= siteName %></div><div class="brandMeta">Affiliate programme</div></div></div><div class="portalActions"><a class="button secondary small" href="/account">My account</a></div></header><main class="portalMain"><% if(message){ %><div class="notice success"><%= message %></div><% } %><% if(error){ %><div class="notice error"><%= error %></div><% } %><section class="accountHero"><div><div class="eyebrow">Affiliate programme</div><h1>Refer people. Build service credit.</h1><p>You do not need an active subscription to participate. Qualifying referrals add service credit to this account, and once you have enough you can activate an eligible CAPTAiNFiN plan.</p></div></section><section class="overviewGrid"><article class="metricCard"><div class="metricLabel">Available <%= currency %> credit</div><div class="metricValue"><%= money(selected.available_minor,currency) %></div><div class="metricSub">Ready to spend</div></article><article class="metricCard"><div class="metricLabel">Pending <%= currency %> credit</div><div class="metricValue"><%= money(selected.pending_minor,currency) %></div><div class="metricSub">Waiting for qualification</div></article><article class="metricCard"><div class="metricLabel">Reward rate</div><div class="metricValue"><%= settings.rewardPercent %>%</div><div class="metricSub">Of qualifying referred spend</div></article></section><section class="sectionBlock"><div class="sectionHead"><div><h2>Your affiliate code</h2><p>Share this code or append it to a registration link as <code>?ref=<%= code %></code>.</p></div></div><div class="panel referralPanel"><div><div class="accessTitle">Referral code</div><div class="referralCode"><%= code %></div></div><div class="accessMeta">Credits become available after at least <%= Math.max(settings.qualificationDelayDays,settings.refundWindowDays) %> day(s). Refunds and chargebacks can reverse unspent credit.</div></div></section><section class="sectionBlock"><div class="sectionHead"><div><h2>Credit balances</h2><p>Balances stay in their original currency; CAPTAiNFiN does not perform automatic FX conversion.</p></div></div><div class="plansGrid"><% ['GBP','USD','EUR'].forEach(function(c){const b=balances.get(c)||{available_minor:0,pending_minor:0}; %><article class="planCard"><div class="planName"><%= c %></div><div class="planPrice"><%= money(b.available_minor,c) %></div><div class="planDescription"><%= money(b.pending_minor,c) %> pending</div><a class="button secondary full" href="/account/affiliate?currency=<%= c %>">Use <%= c %> balance</a></article><% }) %></div></section><section class="sectionBlock"><div class="sectionHead"><div><h2>Activate a plan with <%= currency %> credit</h2><p>Credit-funded plans are activated directly by CAPTAiNFiN. No Stripe or PayPal payment is created.</p></div></div><div class="plansGrid"><% plans.filter(p=>Number(p.price_minor)>0).forEach(function(p){const can=Number(selected.available_minor)>=Number(p.price_minor); %><article class="planCard"><div class="planName"><%= p.name %></div><div class="planPrice"><%= money(p.price_minor,p.currency) %></div><div class="planDescription"><%= p.description||'CAPTAiNFiN service plan' %></div><form class="plainForm" method="post" action="/account/affiliate/redeem"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="planCode" value="<%= p.code %>"><input type="hidden" name="currency" value="<%= currency %>"><button class="button primary full" type="submit" <%= can?'':'disabled' %>><%= can?'Activate with service credit':`Need ${money(Number(p.price_minor)-Number(selected.available_minor),currency)} more` %></button></form></article><% }) %></div></section></main></div></body></html>